9. Expain star and snowflake schema
Star Schema
One central Fact table connected directly to multiple Dimension tables. Dimension tables are denormalized.
Snowflake schema
Extension of Star Schema. Dimension tables are normalized into multiple related tables.

10. Explain SCD types.
Type 0 - Fixed – No changes allowed - No History - DOB
Type 1 - Overwrite the old value - No History - Mobile number
Type 2 - Keep history with multiple rows - Full history - Address change
Type 3 - Keep previous value in extra column - Partial history - Last job title
